hat he  was bad in deep breath but you could you  got the  feeling he was still getting his footing  i mean not so much like he didn't know  how to play him i'm sure  everything was completely calculated but  the character himself the doctor did  not know who he was yet and so therefore  neither do we as the audience  by now he knows who he is so that's it  for me on this one  what did you think about it and you know  what if you haven't caught this episode  yet or you know  even if you have put down in the  comments what is your favorite  dalek episode so far personally i gotta  go asylum of the daleks on that but  there are a lot of good ones out there  drop something down in the comments and  let's talk about it until next time  this council is adjourned

